- `python3 editions/monroe-1.3/tools/formula_metrics.py` on your range, per chapter: hold sentence mean 13.3–14.2, ≥40-word share 2.5–4.5%, and 850–1,050 words a scene wherever the chapter is in range now; do not join sentences to move a number.
