- Write `LANE-A-REPORT.md` or `LANE-B-REPORT.md` in this folder: counts before/after per target, words before/after per chapter, anything declined and why, anything needing a coordinator ruling, and any join you want a second ear on in the listening proof.
- No git commands of any kind. Helper files only inside `state/completion/laneA/` or `laneB/`; delete scratch files; write nothing in the repository root.
# Book 8 completion pass, Step 3 — LANE A REPORT (chapters 1–30)

Same-author texture pass by the O'Connor 1.3 seat (Monroe 1.3 voice). Every word of chapters 1–30 was read in order and edited in place with the Edit tool, one sentence at a time. No script, sed or bulk replacement touched a manuscript file. Nothing under `books/` or `v3-runs/` was opened; no `plan-audit*`, `source-tracking*`, `review-*` or `recheck-*` file was read; `whole-arc-read.md` §11 was not read. No git command was run. Chapters 31–60 were not edited.

