95 edits in 94 hunks across 28 chapters. **Chapters 55 and 59 are unchanged.** No scene was cut, moved or re-staged. No line of dialogue was added, removed or altered, and no attribution was changed. No number of any kind changed. Every replacement of an epithet is a name the viewpoint already uses (Vastin 33, Karis 4, Brom 8, Seln 2) or a pronoun (he 2); no unnamed role was given a name.

Twelve edits made on the way were undone and are not in the totals: ten to spread the Priority 1 and Priority 3 budgets over the whole lane instead of spending them by chapter 45 (§5), and two because a check moved (§4). The authoritative list is `laneB/changes.txt`, generated from `diff` against `pre-lanes/`.

