editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/LANE-A-REPORT.md:253:## 8. Joins for a second ear in the listening proof
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/PASS-BRIEF.md:5:Verdict: PASS. The book holds as a complete novel. Found holding: the calendar and every running count; the fragment and deployment ledger (27 → 28 → 29 → 30 → 32 → 33 → 34 → 35); money; bodies; distances and geography; quotations, names and both seams; the record's limits ("four hundred years" five times, all at the fixed places; "the Architect" three times, never an agent; the two pages unjoined; the chronicle's hole; the deep-layer date unsaid); the knowledge perimeters and the two unpaid debts; consent at every reading; the one death; every protected document once. Source distance: no unprotected source-shaped passage anywhere. **No rebuild. No new material. No scene is cut, moved or re-staged.**
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/PASS-BRIEF.md:7:The coordinator has already applied the read's two accepted line fixes (ch23 "whole way round the bluff"; ch39 "He would do it again, knowing;"). Three "protected-run discrepancies" the read listed (ch30:273; ch45:303–309, 351–357) are DECLINED: in each the spoken words are whole and exact, and what differs is a join or an attribution that the coordinator had expressly left to the author. Do not touch them. The read's proposed rewrite of the closing roll of six in ch60 is DECLINED as well: it is a formal count tableau and stays.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/PASS-BRIEF.md:48:- every BOOK_MAP §10 unit, every unit the audits restored, and every pattern in `protected-patterns.txt`; **every line of dialogue inside or beside a protected exchange, including its attribution** (those joins were settled movement by movement);
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/PASS-BRIEF.md:52:- the record's limits: add no use of "four hundred", "Architect", "un-bound"; never join the leaf to the lamps finding; never *terminal*, *circuit*, *infrastructure*; nothing made is given will, attention or intent; the third sentence stays unsaid; "the court" lowercase;
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/PASS-BRIEF.md:66:- `python3 editions/monroe-1.3/tools/formula_metrics.py` on your range, per chapter: hold sentence mean 13.3–14.2, ≥40-word share 2.5–4.5%, and 850–1,050 words a scene wherever the chapter is in range now; do not join sentences to move a number.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/completion/PASS-BRIEF.md:68:- Write `LANE-A-REPORT.md` or `LANE-B-REPORT.md` in this folder: counts before/after per target, words before/after per chapter, anything declined and why, anything needing a coordinator ruling, and any join you want a second ear on in the listening proof.
